'''Kasa Jizo''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 2.7 Update|Version 2.7]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Ancient Heroes ULTRA SOULS (Gacha Event)|Ancient Heroes ULTRA SOULS]] gacha event. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 7.4 Update|Version 7.4]] gains increased health, range, attack rate and multi-hit attacks. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 13.4 Update|Version 13.4]]. [[Ultra Form]] was added in [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]], and is an improved version of their Normal Form granting increased speed and HP, as well as the [[Survive]] and [[Omni Strike]] abilities.

